# Ask a running autopilot node which control modes IT implements.
#
# Scope: modes of the node answering the call -- NOT every controller variant in the
# workspace. Baseline, CCM, CCM-outer and direct-actuation are separate executables
# (one process per stack, chosen by the launcher), so a node can only report and
# activate what it can switch into internally. A node that has a single fixed mode
# answers with one entry; that is a valid answer, not an error.
---
bool success
string message

# Every mode this node implements, including the active one.
ControllerInfo[] controllers

# Name of the active mode, mirroring the entry with active=true. Empty if the node
# somehow has no active mode.
string active
